Error [jet.MissingWriteMarker]: Cannot write to `world` — it does not have the write-access marker `&`; required before calling `.add()`
  --> tests/ui/pool_read_only_param_mutation.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     world.add(Player{name: "Kai", hp: 100})
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: This method edits the value it's called on; the write-access marker `&` is required
 Fix: Change the parameter to `world: &Pool<Player>` and pass the argument with `&` at the call site
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202

